[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🛡️ What is SENTINEL-X?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSENTINEL-X is a local Security Operations Center (SOC) platform capable of receiving and processing multiple categories of security telemetry, including:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Authentication activity[m
[32m+[m[32m* Network connections[m
[32m+[m[32m* DNS queries[m
[32m+[m[32m* Endpoint/process activity[m
[32m+[m[32m* Firewall events[m
[32m+[m[32m* Simulated security incidents[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe platform processes these events through multiple security layers.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Detection Pipeline[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
