[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEvery major alert, detection, incident, and risk score displayed by the dashboard originates from processed telemetry rather than static frontend data.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# ⚡ Why SENTINEL-X?[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mTraditional beginner cybersecurity projects often stop at:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mLog → Alert[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSENTINEL-X goes further:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mLog[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mUnderstand the event[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mNormalize the data[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mDetect suspicious behavior[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mApply ML anomaly analysis[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mCorrelate related activity[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mCalculate risk[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mCreate an incident[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mExplain why it happened[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mAllow analyst investigation[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mSimulate defensive response[m
[32m+[m[32m ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mVisualize everything in real time[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis makes SENTINEL-X a practical demonstration of how components found in modern **SIEM / SOC / XDR-style workflows** can be designed and integrated.[m
[32m+[m
