[32m+[m[32m# 🧠 Detection Engine[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSENTINEL-X contains an extensible rule-based detection engine.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCurrent detection rules include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mAUTH_REPEATED_FAILURES[m
[32m+[m[32mAUTH_BRUTE_FORCE[m
[32m+[m[32mAUTH_SUCCESS_AFTER_FAILURES[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mNET_HIGH_CONNECTION_FREQUENCY[m
[32m+[m[32mNET_SUSPICIOUS_PORT[m
[32m+[m[32mNET_REPEATED_CONN_FAILURES[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mENDPOINT_SUSPICIOUS_PROCESS[m
[32m+[m[32mENDPOINT_ABNORMAL_EXEC_RATE[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFILE_UNUSUAL_ACTIVITY[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDNS_EXCESSIVE_QUERIES[m
[32m+[m[32mDNS_SUSPICIOUS_DOMAIN_PATTERN[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe detection engine evaluates incoming events and produces structured detections containing information such as:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Detection type[m
[32m+[m[32m* Severity[m
[32m+[m[32m* Confidence[m
[32m+[m[32m* Source information[m
[32m+[m[32m* Related event[m
[32m+[m[32m* Detection rule[m
[32m+[m[32m* Explanation[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# 🤖 ML Anomaly Detection[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSENTINEL-X also contains a machine-learning anomaly detection layer.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Model[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Isolation Forest**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe ML pipeline extracts numerical features from telemetry and evaluates whether observed behavior deviates from the learned baseline.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mTelemetry[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mFeature Extraction[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mBaseline Analysis[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mIsolation Forest[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mAnomaly Score[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mRisk / Detection Pipeline[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe ML subsystem is intentionally explainable and integrated into the broader detection pipeline rather than functioning as an isolated model demonstration.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# 🔗 Event Correlation[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIndividual events do not always represent an attack by themselves.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSENTINEL-X correlates related detections and events to identify broader security activity.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFor example:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mMultiple Login Failures[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mSuccessful Login[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mSuspicious Network Activity[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mEndpoint Activity[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mCorrelated Security Incident[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis allows analysts to investigate activity as an incident rather than viewing thousands of unrelated alerts.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# 🎯 Risk Scoring[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSENTINEL-X calculates transparent risk scores using security factors such as:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Detection severity[m
[32m+[m[32m* Event characteristics[m
[32m+[m[32m* Threat indicators[m
[32m+[m[32m* Correlation context[m
[32m+[m[32m* Anomaly information[m
[32m+[m[32m* Asset importance[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe goal is not simply to say:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m> "Something is suspicious."[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe platform attempts to answer:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m> **"How serious is this activity, and why?"**[m
[32m+[m
